  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "不動產估價實務研習",
    "sub_ename": "REAL ESTATE VALUATION PRACTICE TRAINING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程訓練估價專業技能與分析解釋能力，包括地上權估價、都市更新權利變換估價、容積代金估價三種估價實務，以配合都市計畫擬定或公有財產活化。",
    "describe_eh": "This course trains valuation professional skills and interpretation capabilities,  including superficial rights valuation, urban renewal rights conversion valuation, and volume transfer valuation, in order to coordinate with the formulation of urban plans or the revitalization of public property.",
